  type_array_err_length.pcpp - break step of type_array.pcpp:
  two static arrays of other bounds are other types (SM0200)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_length.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_length.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
